<section class="why-choose-section" id="why-choose">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header text-center">
      <span class="badge-pill">COMPLIANCE & QUALITY</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">WHY WORLD SURGEONS CHOOSE XENTIA</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        Combining century-old Sialkot craftsmanship with modern CNC milling and certified metallurgical standards.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="features-grid">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="feature-title">German DIN 1.4021 Steel</h3>
        <p class="feature-text">We source certified stainless steel billets from trusted European foundries with verified chemical trace analysis for manganese, carbon, and chromium.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M2.458 12C3.732 7.943 7.523 5 12 5c4.478 0 8.268 2.943 9.542 7-1.274 4.057-5.064 7-9.542 7-4.477 0-8.268-2.943-9.542-7z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="feature-title">Microscopic Jaw Alignment</h3>
        <p class="feature-text">Every single needle holder, forcep, and micro scissor undergoes 40x optical microscope inspection to guarantee zero cross-over and smooth action.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19.428 15.428a2 2 0 00-1.022-.547l-2.387-.477a6 6 0 00-3.86.517l-.318.158a6 6 0 01-3.86.517L6.05 15.21a2 2 0 00-1.806.547M8 4h8l-1 1v5.172a2 2 0 00.586 1.414l5 5c1.26 1.26.367 3.414-1.415 3.414H4.828c-1.782 0-2.674-2.154-1.414-3.414l5-5A2 2 0 009 10.172V5L8 4z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="feature-title">Boil & Copper Sulfate Passivation</h3>
        <p class="feature-text">All instruments pass ASTM A380 / A967 testing, including 30-minute boiling water and copper sulfate immersion with zero pitting or rust formation.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="feature-title">Factory-Direct Wholesale Pricing</h3>
        <p class="feature-text">Direct manufacturer-to-hospital and B2B pricing with no intermediaries. Significant margin optimization for surgical distributors worldwide.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

